action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P91 on WSL GtkBackend: ported 2026-10-20 from actions/win/P91-focusable.actions; the steps and pass condition are the Windows file's, quoted below. Positions from the AT-SPI dump under WSLg (x11), client coordinates, origin empty; a control named in a row's note was looked up by that name. Estimated rather than read, to be checked against the capture: 100,164 240,164 370,164 .
# P91(WSL):由 actions/win/P91-focusable.actions 移植(2026-10-20),步驟與通過條件同下方 Windows 原文；座標取自 WSLg 下的 AT-SPI,為 client 座標。
# P91 on Windows, WinUIBackend: .focusable() on plain colour panels -- the same
# steps as actions/mac/P91-focusable.actions, re-measured for WinUI.
# Measured 2026-10-19 with testapp/test_support/measure/measure_win.zsh, in DIPs
# (display at 125%; Win32Synthesiser scales DIPs to pixels). Window 434 x 558 DIPs.
# The panels are not UIA elements, so their row comes from the neighbours:
# "focus changes heard" ends at y 154 and the legend starts at y 240, which
# holds 70-high panels with the 8-DIP spacing; they start at the title's x 37.5,
# 110 wide, 14 apart -> A (92,197), B (216,197), off (340,197). Buttons: focus A
# (71,350), focus B (146,350), focus none (231,350), focus off (74,387).
# Expected at the end: "A heard: ab", "B heard: cde", "off heard:" empty,
# "refusal check: refused (correct)", and the focus on A with its ring drawn.
# c is typed after pressing B, d after Tab from A, e after the "focus B" button.
# Replay with --showtime 14: the steps take about 11 s and a shorter show closes the app mid-file (rc=6). Passed 2026-10-19 on WinUI, Swift 6.4.1: all of the above, focus changes heard 10. 重放需 --showtime 14(約 11 秒);2026-10-19 於 WinUI 通過。
# P91(Windows,WinUIBackend):普通色塊上的 .focusable(),步驟與 actions/mac/P91-focusable.actions 相同，座標為
# WinUI 重新量測。2026-10-19 以 measure_win.zsh 量測，單位 DIP(顯示 125%;Win32Synthesiser 會把 DIP 換成像素)。
# 色塊不是 UIA 元素，所以由相鄰元素推算其所在列；座標見上方英文。結束時應為:A heard: ab、B heard: cde、
# off heard: 空白、refusal check: refused (correct),焦點在 A 且畫出外框。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let the window settle,gtk
click,264,317,,left,,,focus none first,gtk
sleep,,,,,,300000,,gtk
click,100,164,,left,,,press panel A -- focused: a,gtk
sleep,,,,,,500000,,gtk
key,,,,,a,,,gtk
key,,,,,b,,A heard: ab,gtk
sleep,,,,,,300000,,gtk
click,240,164,,left,,,press panel B -- focused: b,gtk
sleep,,,,,,500000,,gtk
key,,,,,c,,B heard: c,gtk
sleep,,,,,,300000,,gtk
click,72,317,,left,,,the focus A button -- from code,gtk
sleep,,,,,,500000,,gtk
key,,,,,tab,,Tab from A must reach B,gtk
sleep,,,,,,500000,,gtk
key,,,,,d,,B heard: cd,gtk
sleep,,,,,,300000,,gtk
click,264,317,,left,,,focus none,gtk
sleep,,,,,,500000,,gtk
key,,,,,y,,no panel is focused -- nobody may hear this,gtk
sleep,,,,,,300000,,gtk
click,162,317,,left,,,the focus B button,gtk
sleep,,,,,,500000,,gtk
key,,,,,e,,B heard: cde,gtk
sleep,,,,,,300000,,gtk
click,76,359,,left,,,focus off -- must be refused,gtk
sleep,,,,,,700000,,gtk
key,,,,,z,,the off panel must not hear this,gtk
sleep,,,,,,300000,,gtk
click,370,164,,left,,,press the off panel itself -- still no focus,gtk
sleep,,,,,,500000,,gtk
key,,,,,z,,,gtk
sleep,,,,,,300000,,gtk
click,72,317,,left,,,end on A so the focus ring is in the capture,gtk
sleep,,,,,,3000000,let the capture land,gtk
